  "known_observations": [
    "Kernel creates virtual IFB/tunnel interfaces with -nic none. Fixture rejects hardware interfaces, global addresses, and a default IPv4 route; it allows these unaddressed kernel virtual interfaces.",
    "The official Ubuntu ssh.service uses KillMode=process. Stop briefly reported an sshd-session process remaining; the validated stop contract is listener shutdown and unit inactivity, not forcibly terminating every established session.",
    "systemd-ssh-generator created a guest AF_UNIX local socket. No external TCP listener or host forwarding was enabled.",
    "QEMU uses stock project hardware initcall blacklist and no physical BCM network/USB/Wi-Fi hardware, so this is not hardware acceptance."
  ],
